  "title": "Notice on Scholarships Open for Application",
  "summary": "\u70B9\u51FB\u84DD\u5B57 \u5173\u6CE8\u6211\u4EEC Two scholarships below are now open for application. Please pay attention to the application eligibility, required materials, and their respective application deadlines. Good luck! Scholarship 1 Scholarship 2 \u9A6C\u6765\u897F\u4E9A\u9A7B\u534E\u5927\u4F7F\u9986\u6559\u80B2\u5904 \u6700\u2026",
  "body": "\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-70fd23cb3578bb0a7115af7d3cf515eb.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u70B9\u51FB\u84DD\u5B57 \u5173\u6CE8\u6211\u4EEC\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo scholarships below are now open for application. Please pay attention to the application eligibility, required materials, and their respective application deadlines. Good luck!\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScholarship 1 \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-6a330ba6f694a70b99423dc9de95f350.jpeg\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-335676a82545c322b3a46f2e28dfdc92.jpeg\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-6126d09b7339cae7002f15e44444af34.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-5a57577d1199314c03430f35a3b20b6f.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-5a57577d1199314c03430f35a3b20b6f.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-5a57577d1199314c03430f35a3b20b6f.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-5a57577d1199314c03430f35a3b20b6f.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScholarship 2 \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-6862f4b79af864dc01efc9a200c38d86.jpeg\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-4e4d64cf8d0c24eb8b628bf8902fcb8f.jpeg\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://silkroute.cc/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/frc-1d3ba2c33504cfd30d7